# Zombie: a shambling corpse. Actions read from one wrapping 10-wide strip (idle 0-9, walk 10-18, attack 19-29, hurt 37-42, death 43-54); the sheet also holds a crawl cycle left unimported.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet zombie_v3.ppm
cell 64 64

bank ZOMBIE_V3
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : lin 0-9
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : lin 10-18
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : lin 19-29
seq HURT   once ticks=3 : lin 37-42
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : lin 43-54
